        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          102 Jisu Ringcthau Dat Kan the",
            "                                 7.7.7.7",
            "          Doh hei B",
            "",
            "          1. Jisu ringcthau dat kan the;",
            "             Baanch'raa gaanvnei rui saa e.",
            "             Baanch'raa gaanvnei tei ruina",
            "             Roukham tei laancpatlou the.",
            "",
            "          2. Zauczihmei nunc baanc khoutei,",
            "             Meic Nac Mpouh Jisu ta,",
            "             Tiipatna swluai pwni;",
            "             Neihthumh nungc ringcthau dat 'ni.",
            "",
            "          3. Twna dinc kasuakcloumei",
            "             Hei guangtangh khang saalou the.",
            "             Lwm makmei sw la ri tho;",
            "             Kamei guang dat pwni the.",
            "",
            "          4. Kandih paapc zinghmei guay ta",
            "             Ngam lana thau dat kan the.",
            "             Ravguangc Nac swpui zaengrui",
            "             Kapu pamv nzwan kan the.",
            "",
            "          5. Thuancku o he meic guay le;",
            "             Thuanc o he Halleluiah !",
            "             Thuancku o kahym daic diu;",
            "             Thuanc o he Halleluiah !"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
